		"note": [
			{
				"text": "\n            An improper authentication vulnerability [CWE-287] in the Fortinet Privileged Access Agent Chrome Extension may allow a remote unauthenticated attacker to proxy a user's browser traffic through attacker controlled servers if the user visits a malicious website.\n        ",
